            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Linda T"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I thought this was a nice soup. I browned the beef and bacon up and then added everything in the crockpot and cooked for several hours. I am not much for canned soups so I think next time it would be better to use a can of beans and my own seasoning mix",
            "datePublished": "2012-10-15T18:44:53.827Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
