            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MOLSON7"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was ok and I am going to play around with it a little more. I did not like the turkey bacon and will use Italian bacon next time. Also thought the basil was a little strong. Will increase broth and decrease water a bit. I browned the meat, bacon, an onion and some garlic before continuing. The noodles soak up a lot of the broth it is very thick.",
